msgid "Every user and everything in their home folders (documents, pictures, browser data) is deleted, and all settings: passwords, computer name, Wi-Fi networks, VPNs, time zone. Only the system stays. This can't be undone.\n\nThe computer restarts now; the reset takes a few seconds, then the setup starts as after installing."
